### Fazer login
# @name login
POST http://localhost:40000/Login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "admin",
    "password": "admin"
}

### Listar todos os médicos
GET http://localhost:40000/getAllMedicos
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}

### Buscar médico por ID
GET http://localhost:40000/getMedicoByID/1
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}

### Cadastrar médico
POST http://localhost:40000/insertMedico
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}

{
    "crm": "123456",
    "nome": "João da Silva",
    "especialidade": "Cardiologia"
}

### Atualizar médico
PUT http://localhost:40000/updateMedico/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}

{
    "crm": "123496",
    "nome": "João Silva Atualizado",
    "especialidade": "Clínica Geral"
}

### Excluir médico
DELETE http://localhost:40000/deleteMedico/1
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}